title: 'Add Helixstreet bootnodes for Polkadot, Kusama, Asset Hub Polkadot, and People Polkadot'

doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: |-
    Adds eight dual-stack (IPv4/IPv6) Helixstreet WS and WSS bootnode multiaddrs to the
    embedded chain specifications for Polkadot (`polkadot/node/service/chain-specs/polkadot.json`),
    Kusama (`polkadot/node/service/chain-specs/kusama.json`), Polkadot Asset Hub
    (`cumulus/parachains/chain-specs/asset-hub-polkadot.json`), and Polkadot People
    (`cumulus/parachains/chain-specs/people-polkadot.json`).
    No crate API or runtime code changes.

crates:
- name: polkadot-service
  bump: none
- name: polkadot-parachain-bin
  bump: none
